You concentrate your will in a cone in front of you, condensing the air into a tangible, solid form.

Any creatures caught inside take [249, 335, 402, 458, 508 (TL1-5; MP 100)] physical damage.

Any places with no creatures will be filled with solid air, blocking the way for [0, 3, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage will increase with your Mindpower.
